// hashed_id.gk — Polydat module
//
// Generates a bounded hashed ID from an input value.
//
// Inputs (inferred): input, bound
// Output: hashed_id (a bare module's export is the binding named after
// the module — i.e. the file/function name, here `hashed_id`).

h := hash(input)
hashed_id := mod(h, bound)
